        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetRefrainPolicy</h2><div><p>Conveys prohibited actions which an information custodian, receiver, or user is not permitted to perform unless otherwise authorized or permitted under specified circumstances.  Examples:\nprohibit redisclosure without consent directive</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html#v3-ActCode-RefrainPolicy\">RefrainPolicy</a></li></ul></div>"
        }
      }
      extension {
