                       \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on for specialty care as defined by the respective Specialty Board.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CVSC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-CVSC\"> </a></td><td>certified vascular surgery care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on for specialty care as defined by the respective Specialty Board.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240LGPC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-LGPC\"> </a></td><td>licensed general physician care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken-on for physician care of a patient as defined by a governmental licensing agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_ActCredentialedCareProvisionProgramCode)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-ActCode-_ActCredentialedCareProvisionProgramCode\">\302\240</a></td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:The type and scope of legal and/or professional responsibility taken-on by the performer of the Act for a specific subject of care as described by an agency for credentialing programs within organizations.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AALC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-AALC\"> </a></td><td>accredited assisted living care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AAMC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-AAMC\"> </a></td><td>accredited ambulatory care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240ABHC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-ABHC\"> </a></td><td>accredited behavioral health care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240ACAC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-ACAC\"> </a></td><td>accredited critical access hospital care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240ACHC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-ACHC\"> </a></td><td>accredited hospital care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AHOC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-AHOC\"> </a></td><td>accredited home care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240ALTC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-ALTC\"> </a></td><td>accredited long term care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AOSC<a name=\"v3-ActCode-AOSC\"> </a></td><td>accredited office-based surgery care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the respective accreditation agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CACS<a name=\"v3-ActCode-CACS\"> </a></td><td>certified acute coronary syndrome care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the disease management certification agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CAMI<a name=\"v3-ActCode-CAMI\"> </a></td><td>certified acute myocardial infarction care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the disease management certification agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CAST<a name=\"v3-ActCode-CAST\"> </a></td><td>certified asthma care</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description:Scope of responsibility taken on by an organization for care of a patient as defined by the disease management certification agency.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CBAR<a name=\"v3-ActCode-CBAR\"> </a></td><td>certified bariatric surgery care</td><td>\n                  