        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetParticipationVerifier</h2><div><p>A person who verifies the correctness and appropriateness of the service (plan, order, event, etc.) and hence takes on accountability.</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/ParticipationType/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/ParticipationType/cs.html#v3-ParticipationType-VRF\">VRF</a></li></ul></div>"
        }
