        profile {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/shareablevalueset"
        }
      }
      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetParticipationTargetSubject</h2><div><p>The principle target that the service acts on.  E.g. the patient in physical examination, a specimen in a lab observation. May also be a patient\'s family member (teaching) or a device or room (cleaning, disinfecting, housekeeping). Note: not all direct targets are subjects, consumables, and devices used as tools for a service are not subjects.  However, a device may be a subject of a maintenance service.</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/ParticipationType/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ParticipationType</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/ParticipationType/cs.html#v3-ParticipationType-SBJ\">SBJ</a></li></ul></div>"
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-standards-status"
        }
        value {
          code {
            value: "external"
          }
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-fmm"
        }
        value {
          integer {
          }
        }
      }
