        }
      }
      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetProvenanceEventCurrentState</h2><div><p>Specifies the state change of a target  Act, such as a document or an entry, from its previous state as a predecessor Act. For example, if the target Act is the result of a predecessor Act being &quot;obsoleted&quot; and replaced with the target Act, the source ProvenanceEventCurrentState Act code would be  &quot;obsoleted&quot;.</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"../../v3/ProvenanceEventCurrentState-AS/vs.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v3-ProvenanceEventCurrentState-AS</a></li><li>Import all the codes that are contained in <a href=\"../../v3/ProvenanceEventCurrentState-DC/vs.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v3-ProvenanceEventCurrentState-DC</a></li></ul></div>"
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-standards-status"
        }
        value {
          code {
            value: "external"
          }
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-fmm"
        }
        value {
          integer {
          }
        }
      }
      url {
        value: "http://terminology.hl7.org/ValueSet/v3-ProvenanceEventCurrentState"
      }
