      description {
        value: " Specifies the state change of a target  Act, such as a document or an entry, from its previous state as a predecessor Act. For example, if the target Act is the result of a predecessor Act being \"obsoleted\" and replaced with the target Act, the source ProvenanceEventCurrentState Act code would be  \"obsoleted\"."
      }
