        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetRoleClassAgent</h2><div><p>An entity (player) that acts or is authorized to act on behalf of another entity (scoper).</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/RoleClass/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleClass</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/RoleClass/cs.html#v3-RoleClass-AGNT\">AGNT</a></li></ul></div>"
