entry {
  full_url {
    value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint"
  }
  resource {
    value_set {
      id {
        value: "v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint"
      }
      meta {
        last_updated {
          value_us: 1533996000000000
          timezone: "+10:00"
          precision: MILLISECOND
        }
        profile {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/shareablevalueset"
        }
      }
      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Release Date: 2018-08-12</p>\r\n<table class=\"grid\">\r\n <tr><td><b>Level</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td>B<a name=\"v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint-B\"> </a></td><td>beginning</td><td>\n                        Condition is tested every time before execution of the service (WHILE condition DO service).<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td>E<a name=\"v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint-E\"> </a></td><td>end</td><td>\n                        Condition is tested at the end of a repeated service execution.  The service is repeated only if the condition is true (DO service WHILE condition).<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td>S<a name=\"v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint-S\"> </a></td><td>entry</td><td>\n                        Condition is tested once before the service is executed (IF condition THEN service).<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td>T<a name=\"v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint-T\"> </a></td><td>through</td><td>\n                        Condition must be true throughout the execution and the service is interrupted (asynchronously) as soon as the condition turns false (asynchronous WHILE loop).  The service must be interruptible.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td>X<a name=\"v3-ActRelationshipCheckpoint-X\"> </a></td><td>exit</td><td>\n                        Condition is a loop checkpoint, i.e. it is a step of an activity plan and, if negative causes the containing loop to exit.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>"
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-standards-status"
        }
        value {
          code {
            value: "external"
          }
        }
      }
      extension {
        url {
          value: "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/structuredefinition-fmm"
        }
        value {
          integer {
          }
        }
      }
