        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetActPharmacySupplyType</h2><div><p>Identifies types of dispensing events</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html#v3-ActCode-_ActPharmacySupplyType\">_ActPharmacySupplyType</a></li><li>Exclude these codes as defined in <a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActCode</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"../../v3/ActCode/cs.html#v3-ActCode-_ActPharmacySupplyType\">_ActPharmacySupplyType</a></td><td>ActPharmacySupplyType</td><td>Identifies types of dispensing events</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
