        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>V3 Value SetPurposeOfUse</h2><div><p>Supports communication of purpose of use at a general level.</p>\n</div><p>This value set includes codes from the following code systems:</p><ul><li>Include codes from <a href=\"../../v3/ActReason/cs.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-ActReason</code></a> where concept  is-a  <a href=\"../../v3/ActReason/cs.html#v3-ActReason-PurposeOfUse\">PurposeOfUse</a></li></ul></div>"
