      }
      meta {
        last_updated {
          value_us: 1533996000000000
          timezone: "+10:00"
          precision: MILLISECOND
        }
      }
      text {
        status {
          value: GENERATED
        }
        div {
          value: "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Release Date: 2018-08-12</p>\r\n<table class=\"grid\">\r\n <tr><td><b>Level</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td><span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(BindingRealms)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-BindingRealms\">\302\240</a></td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Concepts that can be used as Binding Realms when creating Binding Statements.  These codes are permitted to appear in the InfrastructureRoot.realmCode attribute.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(AffiliateRealms)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-AffiliateRealms\">\302\240</a></td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm codes for official HL7 organizational bodies.  This includes both the HL7 International organization as well as all recognized international affiliates (past and present).  These groups have the ability to bind vocabulary and develop artifacts.  As well, they have the ability to have &quot;ownership&quot; over other binding realms and namespace realms via the owningAffiliate property of those other realm codes.<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AR<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-AR\"> </a></td><td>Argentina</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Argentina<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AT<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-AT\"> </a></td><td>Austria</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Austria<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240AU<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-AU\"> </a></td><td>Australia</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Australia<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240BR<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-BR\"> </a></td><td>Brazil</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Brazil<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CA<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CA\"> </a></td><td>Canada</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Canada<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CH<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CH\"> </a></td><td>Switzerland</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Switzerland<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CL<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CL\"> </a></td><td>Chile</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Chile<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CN<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CN\"> </a></td><td>China</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of China<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CO<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CO\"> </a></td><td>Columbia</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Localized Version<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240CZ<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-CZ\"> </a></td><td>Czech Republic</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Czech Republic<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240DE<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-DE\"> </a></td><td>Germany</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Germany<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240DK<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-DK\"> </a></td><td>Denmark</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Denmark<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240ES<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-ES\"> </a></td><td>Spain</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Spain<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240FI<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-FI\"> </a></td><td>Finland</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Finland<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240FR<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-FR\"> </a></td><td>France</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of France<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240GR<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-GR\"> </a></td><td>Greece</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Greece<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240HR<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-HR\"> </a></td><td>Croatia</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Croatia<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240IE<a name=\"v3-hl7Realm-IE\"> </a></td><td>Ireland</td><td>\n                        \n                           Description: Realm code for use of Ireland<br/>\r\n\n                     </td></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240