ricanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Ojibwayan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-OJB<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-OJB\"> </a></td><td>Southern Ojibwa</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-POT<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-POT\"> </a></td><td>Potawatami</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_SaukFoxKickapoo)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_SaukFoxKickapoo\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-KIC<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-KIC\"> </a></td><td>Kickapoo</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-SAC<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-SAC\"> </a></td><td>Mesquakie</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-SJW<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-SJW\"> </a></td><td>Shawnee</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-BLC<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-BLC\"> </a></td><td>Blackfoot</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-CHY<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-CHY\"> </a></td><td>Cheyenne</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-MEZ<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-MEZ\"> </a></td><td>Menominee</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Ritwan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Ritwan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-YUR<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-YUR\"> </a></td><td>Yurok</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td><span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Caddoan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Caddoan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_NorthernCaddoan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_NorthernCaddoan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ARI<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ARI\"> </a></td><td>Arikara</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-PAW<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-PAW\"> </a></td><td>Pawnee</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-WIC<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-WIC\"> </a></td><td>Wichita</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_SouthernCaddoan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_SouthernCaddoan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-CAD<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-CAD\"> </a></td><td>Caddo</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td><span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Chimakuan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Chimakuan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240x-QUI<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-QUI\"> </a></td><td>Quileute</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td><span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_EskimoAleut)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_EskimoAleut\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Aleut)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Aleut\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ALW<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ALW\"> </a></td><td>Aleut</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Eskimoan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Eskimoan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_InuitInupiaq)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_InuitInupiaq\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ESI<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ESI\"> </a></td><td>North Alaskan Inuktitut</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ESK<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ESK\"> </a></td><td>Northwest Alaska Inuktitut</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>3</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240<span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_SirenikskiYupik)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_SirenikskiYupik\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-EMS<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-EMS\"> </a></td><td>Pacific Yupik Gulf</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ESS<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ESS\"> </a></td><td>Central Siberian Yupik</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>4</td><td>\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240\302\240x-ESU<a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-x-ESU\"> </a></td><td>Central Alaskan Yupik</td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>1</td><td><span style=\"color: grey\"><i>(_Hokan)</i></span> <b><i>Abstract</i></b></td><td><a name=\"v3-AmericanIndianAlaskaNativeLanguages-_Hokan\">\302\240</a></td><td/></tr>\r\n <tr><td>2</td><td>\302\240\302\240<span style=\"